  showmap.txt      afl-showmap over four seeds on the instrumented build (map size 124,596);
  instrumentation-symbols.txt: AFL++ guard symbols per instrumented object, the codec's included.
  plant-b-codec/   positive control: plant-b-codec.diff applied to the box's copy of the codec only (never
                   in the worktree), the harness rebuilt without syncing, then
                   $ SKIP_LEAN_BUILD=1 PIN_CPUS=79 LEAN_HTTP_REMOTE_DIR=lean-http-integrate fuzz/run.sh env AFL_BENCH_UNTIL_CRASH=1 fuzz/fuzz.sh .lake/fuzz/campaigns/plant-b-codec 600 1 200
